  (text "Each LED has its own resistor (6 parallel branches).\nI(LED) ≈ (5.0 V - 2.9 V) / 100 Ω ≈ 20 mA  (typical LED-strip drive current)\nTotal ≈ 125 mA from USB. P(R) ≈ 44 mW (0805 rating 125 mW).\nD1-D6: XINGLIGHT XL-2835WWC-02 warm white 2835 (2800-3000 K), LCSC C2843875\nR1-R6: UNI-ROYAL 0805W8F1000T5E 100R 1% 0805, LCSC C17408" (at 81.28 50.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
